# fleet.roster — the fleet as boxes, one line each:
#   <box-name> <agent> <role> [<from-box>/<snapshot>]
#
# `crew up` converges a box host to this file: existing boxes are started,
# missing ones are minted (from the optional 4th column's gold snapshot when
# given, else the <agent>-box template), baked with the engine at the
# checkout's pin, and armed. It never deletes: a box on the host that is
# not in the roster is left alone and reported.
#
# This is the TARGET environment — the current dual-role claude and codex
# boxes split into single-role members. Each line still needs its own
# GitHub identity at login time (one box per identity), and each new
# identity needs a FLEET_MANIFEST line in shared/conf/fleet.conf plus a
# decision on the governed repos' panel= rosters BEFORE the new reviewers'
# first verdicts are expected.
claude-triage    claude  triage
claude-builder   claude  builder
claude-reviewer  claude  reviewer
codex-builder    codex   builder
codex-reviewer   codex   reviewer
grok-reviewer    grok    reviewer
kimi-reviewer    kimi    reviewer
